# [% root %]

Low-level Perl XS binding generated from the C headers by
`create-sdl3-bindings`. Do not edit the generated files; regenerate them.

## Building

    perl Makefile.PL   # needs `pkg-config --cflags --libs [% pkgConfig %]` to work
    make
    make test
    make install

## Layout

| Module | Header | Functions | Constants |
|--------|--------|----------:|----------:|
[% FOREACH h IN headers %]| `[% h.module %]` | `[% h.header %]` | [% h.functions %] | [% h.constants %] |
[% END %]

Struct and union classes live directly below `[% root %]::`, see
`[% structBase %]` for the object model and `[% pointerClass %]` for untyped
memory. `bindgen-report.txt` lists every declaration that was left out and why.

## Conventions

See `perldoc [% root %]` for how strings, structs, out parameters,
callbacks and variadic functions are mapped.
